    {
      "text": "be thou the mother of thousands, Gen. 24:60. men of truth … to be rulers of thousands, Ex. 18:21 (18:25). you shall put ten thousand to flight, Lev. 26:8 (Deut. 32:30). Saul hath slain his thousands, and David his ten thousands, 1 Sam. 18:7 (21:11; 29:5). a thousand years in thy sight are but as yesterday, Ps. 90:4. one man among a thousand have I found, Eccl. 7:28. A little one shall become a thousand, Isa. 60:22. thousand thousands ministered unto him, and ten thousand times ten thousand stood before him, Dan. 7:10. though thou be little among the thousands of Judah, Micah 5:2.",
